          "heading": "Jake White tipped as leading candidate for Fiji's vacant head coach job",
          "body": "Reports since 7 October have named Jake White as the leading candidate for Fiji's head coach job, the post left open when Fiji Rugby parted ways with Mick Byrne by mutual agreement on 1 April. No appointment has been reported, and the appointee will lead Fiji toward the 2027 Rugby World Cup. Fiji's next Test is France in Round 4 of the Nations Championship."
