          "heading": "Premiership: England's Tom Curry out of Sale side with illness before Harlequins",
          "body": "In the Premiership, England back-rower Tom Curry has withdrawn from Sale Sharks' squad through illness ahead of Sunday's round three game against Harlequins. He was due to start at openside, and director of rugby Alex Sanderson has reshuffled his 23: Christ Tshiunza moves into the back row and Sam Dugdale is promoted to the bench. The rest of Sale's side is as advertised, including Joe Carpenter at full-back, the one-cap England hopeful facing George Furbank."
