          "body": "France's 2026 Nations Championship schedule runs on to Fiji in Round 4, after the Bleus beat Japan 42-15 in Round 3. Across three matches they have won two and lost one, scoring 116 points and conceding 75 for a difference of +41, which leaves them 3 of 12 in the log. Fiji are the next opponents, so the Round 4 fixture is the next item on the calendar."
