          "heading": "Bundee Aki's Connacht lose 36-19 at Glasgow in Friday's URC game",
          "body": "Friday night's URC round-three game at Scotstoun ended in a 36-19 Glasgow win over Connacht, with four of the hosts' five tries coming from the maul. Connacht had Sam Illo sin-binned before half-time and trailed 26-7 before Josh Ioane's two tries brought them back to 26-19. Planet Rugby notes that Connacht last won away at Glasgow in September 2010, at Firhill."
