          "body": "Across their last 11 games, Italy have scored 190 points and conceded 318, averages of 17.3 and 28.9 a game. Their biggest win in that window was 34-19 at home to Chile in November 2025, an International Friendlies fixture. In the three Nations Championship matches of 2026 so far, Italy are P3 W0 D0 L3, with 37 points scored and 131 conceded, and the next test is Italy v South Africa in Round 4."
