          "heading": "Los Pumas 7s beat Chile 24-5 to win men's Sudamericano sevens title",
          "body": "Argentina's men's sevens side, Los Pumas 7s, won the Sudamericano de Seven at Carlos Paz Rugby Club in Villa Carlos Paz on 10-11 October, beating Chile 24-5 in the final. The men had edged Uruguay 19-12 and Chile 21-7 in the Gold Zone, with Sebastián Dubuc, Santiago Vera Feld, Luciano González and Santino Zangara scoring the final's tries. The women's Las Yaguaretés also took the title, beating Brazil 19-10, and the top eight finishers in each category earned entry to the regional Los Angeles 2028 Olympic qualifiers."
        },
