          "heading": "Tom Lynagh back in Australia A squad for USA tour, Faessler captains",
          "body": "Flyhalf Tom Lynagh is back in an Australia A squad for the USA tour, which takes in matches against the Eagles in Nashville and New Jersey later this month. The eight-cap Wallaby missed most of the 2026 Super Rugby Pacific season with injury and has since featured for the Reds in Super Rugby AUS. He is likely to split time with Brumbies playmaker Tane Edmed, with the pair hunting for Test returns, while Matt Faessler captains the side."
